# Desk chair (issue 100): seen from behind, above and a little in front (the diagonal class, like the desk it sits at). Seat top and backrest cushions with cream and green ticking running vertically, rounded cushion corners, a light wood top rail, thin oak arms on each side, two short legs. 14 wide by 13 tall in a 1x1 tile, a little smaller than the player. Full ink outline, light from the top-left. `player-type-desk` draws the same chair with the player in it.
size: 16x16
